course: dictionary
lesson: 13082
title: Fifteenth: place and part
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Fifteenth is a number word. It tells you the place of something in a line, like first, second, third. Fourteen things come before the fifteenth one. «The lift stopped on the fifteenth floor.» The lift went past 14 floors before it reached floor 15.
explain: Fifteenth can also mean a part. A fifteenth is one of 15 equal parts. If you cut a cake into 15 equal slices, each slice is a fifteenth of the cake. We write a fifteenth as 1/15, which means one part out of fifteen.
explain: When you see fifteenth, ask yourself: is it talking about a place in order, or about a part of something? Look at the words around it. «Today is my fifteenth birthday» is about order in years, and «Each slice is a fifteenth of the cake» is about a part.
fact: Fifteenth means number 15 in order.
fact: In numbers, fifteenth is written 15th.
fact: A fifteenth is one of 15 equal parts, written 1/15.
fact: «The lift stopped on the fifteenth floor»: fourteen floors come before it.
fact: To check, count: first, second, third, and so on, until you reach fifteen.
exercise: «The lift stopped on the fifteenth floor.» What number does fifteenth stand for? | 16th | 5th | 50 | *15th
exercise: «Each slice is a fifteenth of the cake.» How is a fifteenth written with numbers? | 1/5 | 5/1 | 15 | *1/15
exercise: Maya is the fifteenth child in the line. How many children stand in front of her? | *14 | 16 | 15 | 13
test: «Today is my fifteenth birthday.» What does fifteenth tell you about the birthday? | It is a fifteenth of a year | It is the first birthday | It is the 15th one in order | *It is the 15th birthday
test: If you share a pizza into 15 equal parts and take one, what fraction have you got? | 15/1 | *1/15 | 15/15 | 1/5
exam: Which of these means one of 15 equal parts? | fifteenths of a second, all in a row | the fifteenth floor | fifteen people | *a fifteenth
